# Deliberate-misuse negative tests only. Each entry is anchored on a frame of the test body
# itself, so the same driver faults in any other test stay reported. No leak entries.

# owner:eagle · why: deliberate use-after-destroy/double-destroy negative test · evidence:<build>/sanitize_gate/valgrind · added:2026-10-09
{
   poisoned_handle_addr1
   Memcheck:Addr1
   ...
   fun:*DeviceErrorNothrowTest_LauncherTeardownSurvivesPoisonedHandle_Test*TestBody*
}

